{"title":"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a system of equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d92d1656c1799aea919feb1baf6b949b4219cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x_1 + 4x_2 + 9x_3 + 16x_4 + 25x_5 + 36x_6 + 49x_7 = 1\\\\4x_1 + 9x_2 + 16x_3 + 25x_4 + 36x_5 + 49x_6 + 64x_7 = 12\\\\9x_1 + 16x_2 + 25x_3 + 36x_4 + 49x_5 + 64x_6 + 81x_7 = 123\\end{array}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"451\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>Then determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/e/19e549e87b535086ffd082bb5cdf7fc45368a32e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 16x_1 + 25x_2 + 36x_3 + 49x_4 + 64x_5 + 81x_6 + 100x_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"430\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtract the first equation from the second equation of the original to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/0/6b0494d6cd21e1f0bedc21215cdd8c966da4dfb0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3x_1 + 5x_2 + 7x_3 + 9x_4 + 11x_5 + 13x_6 + 15x_7 = 11\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"15\" />\nSubtract the second equation from the third equation of the original to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d09f68cf625565a0f2c4a202145571035dfe2b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5x_1 + 7x_2 + 9x_3 + 11x_4 + 13x_5 + 15x_6 + 17x_7 = 111\\]\" width=\"408\" height=\"15\" />\nThe difference between the two above equations is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7ed6b1ee782b6b647539bd12adee8b68c3f4e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x_1 + 2x_2 + 2x_3 + 2x_4 + 2x_5 + 2x_6 + 2x_7 = 100\\]\" width=\"372\" height=\"15\" />\nThat means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c388064735790bf4eb50413cfd73cd870ad0756d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7x_1 + 9x_2 + 11x_3 + 13x_4 + 15x_5 + 17x_6 + 19x_7 = 211\\]\" width=\"416\" height=\"15\" />\nAdding that to the third equation of the original results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f976ba8d8c5643373ba8d079a730083b35f25cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16x_1 + 25x_2 + 36x_3 + 49x_4 + 64x_5 + 81x_6 + 100x_7 = \\boxed{334}\\]\" width=\"456\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem is a copy of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8 from the 1989 AIME</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO\">2004 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1655/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.643      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.643      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16552:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017203929 and revision id 96552. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}